[{"id":"playwright-xdist-session","type":"choice","priority":3,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["pytest-xdist","并行"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>启用 pytest-xdist 后，Session 级 Fixture 通常执行多少次？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>B\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>xdist worker 是独立进程，各自拥有 Session 生命周期，因此共享外部资源仍需唯一命名、锁或专用隔离。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>xdist 改变的是进程边界：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">主进程\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ├─ worker 1：Session Fixture 一次\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  └─ worker 2：Session Fixture 一次\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>因此 Session 不是整台机器唯一执行一次；共享外部资源需要按 worker 命名、加锁，或使用独立隔离环境。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["B"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>整台机器只执行一次\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>每个 worker 各执行一次\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>每条测试执行一次\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"python-env-implementation","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","CPython","解释器"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(二)运行环境与代码组织.md","articleTitle":"Python(二)运行环境与代码组织","articlePath":"posts/5891c180/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(二)运行环境与代码组织.md","articleTitle":"Python(二)运行环境与代码组织","articlePath":"posts/5891c180/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Python、CPython 与当前解释器版本分别指什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Python 是语言与规范；CPython 是一种实现；当前解释器版本是实际执行代码的运行时版本。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>“Python 3.14”通常指语言/标准库版本；CPython 是实现，当前进程的解释器则是你真正运行代码的对象。诊断时把两者分开记录：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> platform\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> sys\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(platform.python_implementation())  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 例如 CPython\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">print\u003c/span>(sys.version)                       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 当前实现与版本\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>业务代码应依赖语言和标准库公开保证；讨论 GIL、引用计数、字节码或对象缓存时，必须同时写明实现和版本。不要把 CPython 的优化现象当成所有 Python 实现都必须遵守的语义。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-error-context","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","with","上下文管理","资源"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>with\u003c/code> 解决什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它保证进入后的退出清理在成功、异常和提前返回时都执行。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>with\u003c/code> 把资源所有权绑定到一个可观察的代码块，离开代码块时调用退出协议：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">from\u003c/span> pathlib \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">import\u003c/span> Path\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">with\u003c/span> Path(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;input.txt&quot;\u003c/span>).\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">open\u003c/span>(encoding=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;utf-8&quot;\u003c/span>) \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">as\u003c/span> file:\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    content = file.read()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 离开 with 后文件已关闭，即使 read 或后续处理抛错也会执行清理。\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>文件、锁、事务和临时目录都应由明确的所有者管理。上下文管理器只有在确实处理了异常时才应抑制它；否则应让异常继续传播，避免调用者误以为资源操作成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]